# Beast 3.0 Community Operations Division

The Community Operations Division serves as the frontline engagement and support authority for members, contributors, and participants within the Beast 3.0 ecosystem.

## Mission

Ensure smooth onboarding, transparent member support, active community coordination, and secure credential verification for all DAO participants.

## Core Responsibilities

- Member Onboarding & Directory Management
- Support Ticketing & Issue Resolution
- Community Role & Access Verification
- Decentralized Communication Routing

## Connected Systems

- Identity & Credentials Division (`div-05-identity`)
- Communications Division (`div-09-communications`)
- Legal Framework Division (`div-12-legal-framework`)

## Status

Development
